# Components & composition

**When:** creating or restyling buttons, forms, navigation, tables, cards, feedback, or modals under `web/`.

Use token variables (`frontend/tokens.mdc`) for color, type, space, radius, and motion. Prefer existing components in `web/src/components/` and vertical UI before adding a new primitive.

---

## Composition

- Prefer **small composable pieces** over one mega-component with many boolean props.
- **Extend the closest existing control** (Button, Input, Modal, …) before inventing a new visual variant.
- Every interactive component needs: default, hover, focus, active, disabled, loading, and error as applicable.
- One icon library; consistent stroke. Naming: predictable and token-aligned.

---

## Buttons

- Minimum touch target: **`--touch-target-min`** / **44×44px**.
- Heights: compact ~`36px`, default ~`40px`, large ~`48px` (match existing classes).
- **One primary button** per view/section.
- Labels: sentence case, verb-first ("Save changes", "Get started").
- Loading: spinner replaces label; keep dimensions stable.
- Destructive: error styling only after confirmation.

Style with token vars (`--color-*`, `--radius-md`, `--text-sm`, duration/ease tokens). Example shape (illustrative — prefer shared Button classes):

```css
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--color-brand);
  color: var(--color-text-inverse, #fff);
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: 500;
  transition: background var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-default),
    transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-brand-hover); }
.btn-primary:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
.btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-focus); }
.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
```

---

## Inputs & forms

- Always pair inputs with **visible labels** — never placeholder-only.
- Error text below the field, linked for a11y (`aria-describedby`); specific copy.
- Helper text tertiary; labels secondary, ~13px / `font-weight: 500`.
- Group related fields under a section header; mark required with `*` and explain once.
- Submit: right-aligned or full-width on desktop — not left-aligned alone.
- Validate format on blur; required on submit.

---

## Navigation

### Top bar

- Height ~`56px–64px`; sticky; subtle blur/border per existing shell CSS.
- Logo left; primary nav center/left; account/CTA right.
- Active item: weight + brand underline or pill.
- Mobile: hamburger → drawer / full-screen.

### Sidebar

- Width ~`240px–260px` (collapsed ~`64px–72px`).
- Section headers: small caps / tertiary (`--data-caps-*` / `--section-caps-*` tokens).
- Items ~`36px` tall, `--radius-md`; active uses brand-subtle + brand text.
- Icons ~`18px`; outline inactive, filled active when that pattern exists.

---

## Data display

### Tables

- Header: small caps, secondary color (`--data-caps-*`).
- Row height ~`48px–56px`; cell padding from `--table-cell-padding-*`.
- Row dividers only; avoid column dividers unless dense.
- Hover: subtle bg; sticky header on long tables; no striped rows by default.
- Empty: illustration/icon + headline + subtext + CTA — never a blank table.

### Cards

- Surface + **border or shadow — not both** (product chrome: border).
- Padding ≥ `--space-6` (~24px) when possible; radius `--radius-lg` / `--radius-xl`.
- Interactive hover: strengthen border or elevation token, ~`150ms`.

### Metrics

- Value large + semibold; label smaller secondary; deltas use semantic colors.
- Sparklines minimal: no axes, single color.

---

## Feedback & status

### Toasts

- Desktop bottom-right; mobile bottom-center; width ~`320–400px`.
- Auto-dismiss: info/success shorter; warning longer; errors manual.
- Always a close control; stack newest on top.

### Loading

- Prefer **skeletons** over spinners for content regions.
- Button loading: in-place spinner, disabled, same size.
- Full-page spinner: delay ~`300ms` to avoid flash.
- Progress bar for ops >2s.

### Empty & error

- Empty: icon + title + one-line description + primary CTA.
- Inline field errors: red border + persistent message (not tooltip-only).
- Page errors: banner; 404/500 friendly with home/back — no raw technical codes.

---

## Modals & overlays

```
Backdrop → container (max-width small/default/large) → header + body + footer
Body scrollable; max-height ~70vh; footer actions right-aligned, primary rightmost
```

- **One modal at a time** — no stacks.
- Focus trap while open; `Escape` closes; backdrop dismiss unless destructive confirm.
- Mobile: bottom sheet with top radius only.
- Destructive confirm: explicit named action (not vague "OK").

---

## Microcopy

- **Sentence case** in UI (not Title Case / ALL CAPS except small labels).
- Errors: what went wrong **and** how to fix.
- Confirmations: describe the consequence.
- Placeholders: examples, not instructions.
- Loading: specific ("Loading transactions…" not "Loading…").
- Avoid "Click here", context-free "Learn more", bare "Submit", passive voice.

---

## Perception

- Optimistic UI where safe; revert on error.
- Instant feedback within ~`100ms` of tap.
- Reserve space for async content (avoid CLS).
- Lazy-load below-fold media; modern image formats when adding assets.

---

## Do not (UI chrome)

- More than one primary CTA per view
- Placeholder as the only input label
- Error messages only inside tooltips
- Modals for non-critical info (prefer inline / toast)
- Generic clipart icons — use the product icon set
- Boolean-prop explosion on a single Button / Field component
